<design_system>
7. COMPONENT DESIGN SYSTEM
7.1 Buttons
Button Hierarchy
```
Primary:    Filled, accent background, white text — one per page section maximum
Secondary:  Outlined (1px border, accent color), transparent background
Ghost:      No border, subtle hover background shift
Destructive: Outlined red — never filled red as a default state
Link:       Text-only, accent color, underline on hover
```
Button Anatomy
Minimum height: 40px (standard), 48px (primary CTA), 36px (compact/table)
Minimum width: 80px (prevents tiny buttons)
Icon + label spacing: `gap-2` (8px)
Loading state: replace label with `\\\[Spinner] Processing…`, maintain original button width
Icon-only buttons must have `aria-label` and a tooltip on hover
Button States Matrix
Every button variant must define: Default → Hover → Active/Pressed → Focused → Disabled → Loading
7.2 Tables & Data Grids
Column headers: `text-xs uppercase tracking-wide font-medium text-slate-500`
Row hover: subtle background shift (`bg-slate-50/60` in light mode)
Sortable columns: sort icon visible on hover of header, active sort shows direction indicator
Numeric columns: right-aligned, monospace font
Long text cells: truncate with `truncate` class + tooltip on hover showing full value
Checkbox column: 40px wide, vertically centered
Empty state for filtered-to-zero results: "No results matching your filters" with a clear-filters action
Sticky Headers for Long Tables
```css
thead th { position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--color-surface); z-index: 1; }
```
7.3 Modals & Dialogs
Max width: `max-w-lg` (standard), `max-w-2xl` (content-rich), `max-w-4xl` (preview/full)
Always include a visible close button (top-right `×`) AND close on `Escape` AND close on backdrop click
Focus trap: Tab key cycles only within modal when open
`aria-modal="true"`, `role="dialog"`, `aria-labelledby` pointing to the modal title
Backdrop: `bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm` — not fully opaque
Entry animation: scale from `0.95` to `1` + fade in, `200ms spring`
Never use browser `alert()`, `confirm()`, or `prompt()` — implement custom modal equivalents
7.4 Tooltips & Popovers
Tooltips: appear after `400ms` hover delay (not instant — prevents flash on cursor pass-through)
Maximum tooltip width: 240px
Tooltips are for supplemental information only — never for required instructions
Popovers (interactive tooltips): require `role="dialog"` or `role="tooltip"` based on content
Dismiss: `Escape` key, click outside, or focus leaving the trigger area
7.5 Navigation Components
Tab Groups
Active tab: filled background or prominent underline — not just color change
Tabs must be keyboard-navigable with left/right arrow keys (ARIA tablist pattern)
Never use tabs for navigation that changes the URL — those are links, not tabs
Accordions
Show expand/collapse icon (chevron), rotate `180deg` on open
Smooth height animation: use `grid-rows` trick in CSS or `AnimatePresence` in Framer
Only allow one open at a time unless explicitly multi-select
Dropdown Menus
Max visible items: 8 before scroll, 6 on mobile
Keyboard: arrow keys to navigate, Enter to select, Escape to close
Selected item shows a checkmark or filled indicator, never just bold text
Destructive items (delete, remove) at the bottom, separated by a divider, in red
</design_system>
